    ],
    "text": "My No. KEG/LAN/AQUIS/A3/1/105. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/15/2016/VE/238.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      409.28,
      286.44,
      549.92
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give Notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment Act), No. 28 of 1964 that the Government Intends to acquire the land of Parambe portion Parambewatta described in the schedule given below for re-settlement the people who were displaced due to the earth slides occurred in 2016 in the Divsional Secretariat Division of Kegalle. Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      551.12,
      286.44,
      618.56
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land attached below depicted in preliminary Plan No. 3562 prepared by Surveyor General, Kegalle situated in the Parambe Village of No. 57 B\u2013 Bossella Grama Niladhari In Kegalle Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Kegalle District of Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      620.0,
      286.41,
      676.16
    ],
    "text": "Dates of inquiries for compensation - Lot No. 01 of P.P.K. 3562 20th On the date of March from 9.30 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      539.45,
      387.44
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid lands to be Acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writen before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kegalle on the above mentioned date and on the scheduled time.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      388.64,
      539.42,
      467.84
    ],
    "text": "And are hereby requested to notify me in writing with duplicate of on or before 06th On March the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
